<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9476" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">commūnĭo</span></b> ,
			ōnis, f.
		communis, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a communion</i>, <i>mutual
				participation</i> (several times in Cicero, elsewhere rare).
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b> In gen.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">inter quos est communio legis, inter eos
					communio juris est,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Leg. 1, 7, 23</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sanguinis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Rosc. Am. 22, 63</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">litterarum et vocum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Tusc. 5, 2, 5</span></i>
			: sermonis, * <i><span class="en">Suet.
				Aug. 74</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">parietum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tac.
					A. 15, 43</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">victoriae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 12, 19</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">temporum alicujus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Mil. 36, 100</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">beneficiorum, praemiorum civitatis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Balb. 12, 29</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">visorum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. Ac. 2, 14, 44</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">plures partes communione complecti,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					de Or. 1, 42, 189</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">in pristinā communione manere,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 3, 19, 72</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sagariam communionem inire,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Dig.
					17, 2, 52</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b> In
			eccl. Lat. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<i>Church communion</i>, <i><span class="en">Sulp.
				Sev. Hist. Sacr. 2, 45</span></i>; <i><span class="en">2, 37</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Aug. in
				Ps. 57</span></i>, n. 15.—Hence, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<i>The sacrament of the Lord</i>'<i>s
				supper</i>, <i>communion</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sancti altaris,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Aug. Ep. 54, 6</span></i>
			.</div>
